    "created_at": "2018-02-03T01:13:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-03T01:13:01Z",
    "body": "Generally this is not the best place to ask; nobody here knows why the W3C fork does anything. Fortunately you can ignore it; it's not followed by any browsers.",
