    "created_at": "2018-02-03T07:44:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-03T07:44:43Z",
    "body": "To be clear, the W3C stating something in HTML is deprecated is not generally accepted by the HTML community at large unless the WHATWG also considers it deprecated. In particular, all browsers participate in the WHATWG and as far as we know want `inputmode` to succeed.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
